  "articleBodyHtml": "<h2>Introduction to the Eurobeat Album</h2>\n<p>The Eurobeat album is being announced, and it will be available for purchase or streaming. The album includes a variety of tracks that are expected to be popular among fans.</p>\n<p>The Eurobeat album will be available in different formats, including a full album and a BGM (Background Music) version. The BGM version will be released as part of a video that will premiere on the ENTEL platform after this stream.</p>\n<p>The Eurobeat album is being promoted with a variety of merchandise, including acrylic keychains and stickers. These items are available in 16 different types and are designed to appeal to fans of the album.</p>\n<h2>記事情報</h2>\n<p>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CV2X0B1T5h4</p>",
